2. Modifications to healenium-backend (updated 2026-11-23)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Added, not present upstream:
  * src/main/java/com/epam/healenium/controller/HealwrightDashboardController.java
    Routes: "/" and "/index.html" (dashboard), "/api/config", "/api/telemetry",
    "/api/telemetry/{uid}"; legacy "/healwright/" redirects to "/".
    Telemetry is read from HEALWRIGHT_REPORT_DIR and every absolute directory
    registered by the Healwright client in ~/.healwright/dirs.json (override:
    HEALWRIGHT_REPORT_REGISTRY). No external service is added.
  * src/main/resources/static/healwright/index.html
    Healwright reporting dashboard, mirrored from client/scripts/report-ui.html.

Modified for the Healwright distribution:
  * src/main/resources/images/banner.txt
    Replaced the upstream terminal banner with the Healwright identity.
  * src/main/resources/application.yml
    Changed visible log patterns and file names, reduced Liquibase console
    verbosity, added HEALWRIGHT_LOG_LEVEL with HLM_LOG_LEVEL as a legacy
    fallback, and removed the PostgreSQL password fallback.
  * src/main/resources/db/sql/init.sql
    Added the Healwright schema and user names for new installations. Existing
    database names remain configurable through SPRING_POSTGRES_* variables.
  * src/main/java/com/epam/healenium/service/impl/SettingServiceImpl.java
    Added HEALWRIGHT_LOG_LEVEL as the public runtime setting while retaining
    HLM_LOG_LEVEL and the internal logger hierarchy for compatibility.
  * src/main/resources/logback-spring.xml
    Changed visible logger formatting and rolling file names; retained the
    internal com.epam.healenium logger and legacy logging-level fallback.
  * settings.gradle
    Changed the Gradle project/archive name to healwright-backend.
  * build.gradle
    Changed the publication group to com.healwright and added META-INF/LICENSE
    and META-INF/NOTICE to the executable Spring Boot jar. The upstream
    tree-comparing dependency coordinate is unchanged.

