3. Retained upstream compatibility identifiers
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Java package com.epam.healenium, the /healenium REST routes, and legacy
PostgreSQL identifiers remain for wire and data compatibility. New installations
should use the Healwright database and schema names documented in backend/README.md.
